    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/ctg-getsemani",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Cartagena · Bolívar",
      "headingTitle": "Casa Getsemaní Boutique",
      "mediaAlt": "Patio colonial con arcos blancos y jardín en una casa de Getsemaní",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "2922a4dd-92bc-430b-9131-7b18e810e463",
          "mediaKey": "30d7434a-f9e1-4822-992b-4ab169b747e3",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Casa republicana restaurada a cinco minutos a pie de la Ciudad Amurallada, con patios coloniales y terraza sobre los techos del centro hist&#243;rico.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/49a67cf6d2fa4551b2d9e4ae1199d4dc",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/ctg-bocagrande",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Cartagena · Bolívar",
      "headingTitle": "Torre Bocagrande Beach Resort",
      "mediaAlt": "Piscina rodeada de palmas y sombrillas en un hotel de Bocagrande",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "3e624e88-cbc8-4c7f-8d12-e7426beaba4a",
          "mediaKey": "70a71e8f-cd22-4a9b-a3ce-789b02235abf",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Frente al mar en la primera l&#237;nea de Bocagrande: playa privada, tres piscinas y club de ni&#241;os para viajar en familia.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/bd31235cbd6b400ab1da2ba1e9bdc5af",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/med-provenza",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Medellín · Antioquia",
      "headingTitle": "Provenza Lofts El Poblado",
      "mediaAlt": "Terraza en la azotea con vista abierta sobre la ciudad",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "69062082-a267-4b14-9abb-d0160ef53c5e",
          "mediaKey": "93753a00-7024-448e-861d-6e3a0d7e11b2",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Lofts de dise&#241;o en la Provenza, con rooftop, coworking y caf&#233; de especialidad a pasos de los restaurantes de El Poblado.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/db8ab2bc99b4474881b1ebcd82c2b70f",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "containerType": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "1fc59d8b-7278-4a0a-9b4c-d596ae230372",
      "cssClass": "syn-display--grid syn-grid--tpl-3col syn-grid--gap-lg",
      "mobileCollapseMode": [],
      "spacingBottom": [],
      "spacingInline": [],
      "spacingTop": [],
      "theme": [],
      "udi": "umb://element/c43d42bdbbdd4e78a067a0bdf0d9f42d",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/bog-zonat",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Bogotá · Cundinamarca",
      "headingTitle": "Zona T Executive Suites",
      "mediaAlt": "Recepción de hotel con muebles de madera tallada y lámparas cálidas",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "e9244f03-84c1-4cce-b6df-7e9b0e0bb90e",
          "mediaKey": "9095fa84-7c9d-4308-8dd8-e2e1af138975",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Suites para el viajero de negocios sobre la Zona T, con salas de reuniones, gimnasio 24 horas y desayuno buffet.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/744fb542f6e44b24bfc95ec53b1da8a2",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/eje-salento",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Salento · Quindío",
      "headingTitle": "Finca Mirador del Cocora",
      "mediaAlt": "Rama de cafeto con granos verdes en una finca del Quindío",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "44733f67-c96e-4d4f-82e6-08752390e315",
          "mediaKey": "d4b3370d-021d-4e33-9c89-f26dbaead76d",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Finca cafetera frente al Valle de Cocora, con tour de caf&#233; propio, chimenea y caminatas guiadas al amanecer.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/ac53f02dd241443490e905fd56d19a4d",
      "variantKey": []
    },
    {
      "ariaRole": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "c646696c-8819-4630-bc7a-121f0839bb16",
      "ctaLabel": "Ver la estadía",
      "ctaLink": [
        {
          "name": "Ver la estadía",
          "url": "/viajes/#/travel/estadia/eje-filandia",
          "target": "",
          "udi": null,
          "icon": null,
          "queryString": null
        }
      ],
      "ctaSecondaryLink": [],
      "headingSubtitle": "Filandia · Quindío",
      "headingTitle": "Hacienda Café & Bruma",
      "mediaAlt": "Campo abierto al atardecer con montañas al fondo",
      "mediaReference": [
        {
          "key": "23e8aec0-e694-42df-96f1-192b7d4c7bf4",
          "mediaKey": "d8e2e919-39d6-429d-a117-8e48ebcc4b2b",
          "crops": [],
          "focalPoint": null
        }
      ],
      "textBody": "<p>Hacienda centenaria entre cafetales, con spa de monta&#241;a y catas de caf&#233; de origen en el Paisaje Cultural Cafetero.</p>",
      "udi": "umb://element/8ea45235c1fc4478855dfcd27db53691",
      "variantKey": []
    },
